k":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-22T06:29:00-07:00","id":1460825,"title":"","content":"Oooooh, a new homebrew contracts thread! Oh goody goody! I love these. I can post my perpetually in tuning contract concept. Maybe it will even be done to my satisfaction this time!<br /> <br /> <b>Breath of Yggdrasil (Common) [Steed]</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Heart of Oak and Breath of Life, Grant Me Passage Through Great Strife&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Cost</b>: 1 Glamour<br /> <br /> <b>Dice Pool</b>: None<br /> <br /> <b>Action</b>: Instant<br /> <br /> <b>Effect: </b>The Changeling calls on the properties of the mightiest trees to weather harsh environments. For the rest of the scene, the changeling can breath underwater and in other water-based solutions, respiring through their skin. In addition, the Poisoned tilt is suppressed in action scenes, while the Toxicity of any poisonous substance in the body is reduced by their Wyrd Rating for the rest of the scene. If the Toxicity would be reduced below 1 by this Contract, it is purged from their system permanently. This will further allow them to not take penalties for choking if there is still any breathable air present alongside a poisonous gas. However, if the Changeling is purposefully strangled manually or with a weapon, they still take damage as appropriate.<br /> <br /> <b>Loophole</b>: Properly planting a new sapling gives you free access to this Contract until the end of the current Chapter<br /> <br /> <b>Beast</b>: The Grimm is no mere stoic tree. He is an animalistic embodiment of freedom. When activating this contract underwater, Beasts call upon that nature to temporarily grow features like fins, webbed digits or otherwise, that allow them to move at their full Speed while swimming.<br /> <br /> <b>Ogres</b>: Ogres add +3 to their effective Wyrd rating for the purposes of suppressing Toxicity<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 09-22-2021, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}